     A*____________________________________________________________________
     A*
     A          R PG1TEXT
     A                                 15 12'The New Jersey Workers''-
     A                                       Compensation Law was amended-
     A                                       effective April 13,-
     A                                       2000.  The amendment permits-
     A                                       election'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 16 12'by a self-employed person or-
     A                                       partners of any partnership-
     A                                       including partners of a limited-
     A                                       liability partnership and members'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 17 12'of a limited liability company-
     A                                       actively performing services-
     A                                       on behalf of the business-
     A                                       to be deemed employees for the'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 18 12'purpose of receipt of benefits-
     A                                       and the payment of premiums. -
     A                                       This election does not-
     A                                       affect the insurance-
     A                                       obligations for'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 19 12'employees other than the-
     A                                       self-employed person,-
     A                                       partners or members.'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 21 12'The election must be-
     A                                       made at the time the policy-
     A                                       is purchased or renewed-
     A                                       and must be effective at the-
     A                                       inception date of'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 22 12'the policy.  It is important-
     A                                       to note that the election-
     A                                       cannot be rescinded during-
     A                                       the policy period and-
     A                                       that in the case of any'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 23 12'partnership including a-
     A                                       limited liability partnership-
     A                                       or limited liability company,-
     A                                       ALL of the partners or ALL-
     A                                       of the members'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 24 12'must elect the coverage. -
     A                                       You will be required to pay-
     A                                       a premium based on the-
     A                                       remuneration and duties of-
     A                                       the self-'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 25 12'employed person or each-
     A                                       partner or each member.'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 27 12'The insurer or insurance-
     A                                       producer shall not be liable-
     A                                       in an action for damages-
     A                                       on account of the failure of-
     A                                       a business,'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 28 12'limited liability partnership,-
     A                                       limited liability company-
     A                                       or partnership-
     A                                       to elect to obtain workers''-
     A                                       compensation coverage for'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 29 12'a self-employed person,-
     A                                       limited liability partner,-
     A                                       limited liability company member-
     A                                       or partner, unless the insurer-
     A                                       or insurance'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 30 12'producer causes damage by a-
     A                                       willful, wanton or grossly-
     A                                       negligent act of commission-
     A                                       or omission.'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 32 12'Whether electing or-
     A                                       rejecting coverage, it will-
     A                                       be necessary to complete the-
     A                                       information as requested below. -
     A                                       This'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 33 12'completed form must then be-
     A                                       returned to the carrier/producer. -
     A                                       A copy of this Notice and proof-
     A                                       of mailing should be'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A                                 34 12'retained for your records.'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20090 T1V10037)
     A*____________________                                            ____
